      "notes": "27\" 5120 x 2880 display. One upstream Thunderbolt 3 port to the host carries video, data and the display's own speakers, mics and camera, and charges the host at up to 96 W; three downstream USB-C ports at up to 10 Gb/s make it the desk's hub. Internal PSU, 100-240 V. Dimensions are with the tilt-adjustable stand (623 x 478 x 168 mm). On the tilt- and height-adjustable stand it is 207 mm deep and 479-583 mm tall; with the VESA mount adapter it is 623 x 362 x 31 mm. The 100 x 100 mm VESA pattern is only on the VESA mount adapter configuration; the stand versions cannot be wall mounted. The power cord is attached and is not meant to be removed, so there is no mains inlet to draw a lead to; it is left off the ports, which means this display is not counted against the room's free sockets. Apple's tech specs give no power consumption, so none is modelled. Ports, sizes and weights from Apple's tech specs.",
